wienerlabs/aperture — Copyright (c) 2026 Makinci — MIT

  circuits/payment.circom
      The compliance circuit, ported from aperture's Solana circuit and
      reparameterised for EVM addresses.
  services/prover/src/hash.js
      Ported directly; the hashing has to agree with the circuit byte for byte.
  services/prover/src/openapi.js
      Inherited, then corrected where the spec had drifted from the code.
